["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">区切る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くぎる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分割；分开；区分；划分；标记界限；标点；加标点符号；插入停顿；断句</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225535\">グラウンドは<ruby>白線<rp>(</rp><rt>はくせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で３つに<ruby>区切<rp>(</rp><rt>くぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">格拉旺德以白线分为三部分。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">潜る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くぐる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">穿过；通过；从下面通过；潜水；潜入水中；躲避；绕过；逃脱；度过；克服；渡过难关</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">草</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">草；杂草；药草；茅草；忍者；大麻；非正品的；劣质的；哈哈；大笑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175661\"><ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>草<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">月亮上没有草。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">臭い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">臭的；有臭味的；可疑的；蹊跷的；浮夸的；做作的；俗气的；笨拙的；不熟练的；（过于）腥膻的；味道浓烈的；带有……气味的；看起来像；显得像；有……气息的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234678\">あいつが<ruby>臭<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有气味。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">種々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさぐさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">各种；多种；形形色色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鎖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">链；铁链</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215660\">ジョージはその<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>鎖<rp>(</rp><rt>くさり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">乔治把狗连锁了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">腐る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くさる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">腐烂；变质；腐坏；溃烂；（牛奶等）变酸；腐蚀；风化；破碎；变得无用；迟钝；衰弱；生疏；堕落；道德沦丧；腐败；腐化；沮丧；气馁；精神萎靡；情绪低落；厚颜无耻地；无耻地；输掉赌注；湿透；浑身湿漉漉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217994\">これらのオレンジは<ruby>腐<rp>(</rp><rt>くさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些橙子是腐烂的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">櫛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">梳子；梳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152580\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のくしを<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我有木头。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くしゃみ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喷嚏；打喷嚏；（他人打喷嚏时）连说两遍的咒语，以防早死</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225705\">くしゃみが<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我止不住打喷嚏。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2031397\" title=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦心</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">苦心；辛苦；努力；劳苦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211977\">その<ruby>歌手<rp>(</rp><rt>かしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はファンの<ruby>群<rp>(</rp><rt>むら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がる<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>苦心<rp>(</rp><rt>くしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>すす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这位歌手在球迷群体中漫步。