=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くずす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摧毁；拆除；推倒；夷平；扰乱；打乱；破坏平衡；动摇；放松姿态；使自己放松；兑换；找零；写成草体；用行书书写；露出笑容；展颜一笑；降价</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225837\">キャベツは<ruby>生産過剰<rp>(</rp><rt>せいさんかじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>値<rp>(</rp><rt>あたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をくずした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可口可乐因过量产量而低估了价值。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">崩れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くずれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坍塌；崩塌；破裂；变形；散乱；不整洁；失去形状；瓦解；陷入混乱；暴跌；下滑；衰退（股市等）；兑换零钱；破钞；恶化；变坏；（天气等）转差</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195869\"><ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>崩<rp>(</rp><rt>くず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れそうに<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书的山似乎仍然崩溃了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">癖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くせ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">习惯；癖好；倾向；特异性；怪癖；习性；褶皱；皱纹；卷曲；打结</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210240\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>癖<rp>(</rp><rt>くせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>なお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个男孩修复了自己的坏习惯。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くたびれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">累；疲倦；疲惫；用旧；磨损；破损；厌烦（做）；厌倦（做）；受够（了）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156638\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でひどくくたびれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在工作中很生气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">管</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管；管子；管道；梭芯；线轴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打碎；粉碎；压碎；研磨；捣碎；摧毁（希望、信心等）；使破灭；挫败；简化；使通俗易懂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197583\">ピックは<ruby>硬<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>地表<rp>(</rp><rt>ちひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>砕<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くために<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>もち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いられる<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">皮克是用来打破硬地表的长手握手工具。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">破碎；碎裂；粉碎；崩溃；瓦解；衰退；减退（如热情）；消沉（如斗志）；变得不拘礼节；打破拘谨；变得随和；变得浅显易懂；通俗化；感到担忧；感到不安</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224119\">コップが<ruby>地面<rp>(</rp><rt>じめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちて<ruby>砕<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">杯子倒在地上,打碎了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ください</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">请给我；请递给我；请（为我）做；请帮我做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76494\">ニューススタンドで<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请在新闻站听。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くださる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">给予；赐予；赏赐；（尊敬语）为我方做……；惠予；赏光</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78725\"><ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てくださってどうもありがとう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谢谢你来了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" hr