h-Hans\">不要把东西放在嘴里,说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">口ずさむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くちずさむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哼唱；低声唱；轻声哼着</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82898\"><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>台所<rp>(</rp><rt>だいどころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でせっせと<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しながら<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>くち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずさんでいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">妈妈在厨房里吃饭时唱歌。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嘴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くちばし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喙；鸟嘴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">唇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くちびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">唇；嘴唇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124348\"><ruby>冬<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>唇<rp>(</rp><rt>くちびる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があれます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冬季嘴唇干裂。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2032248\" title=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span clas